{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_architecture", "label": "Reflection Journal: Architecture", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_use_core_never_reinvent", "label": "Design principle: use Moodle core, never reinvent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each mechanism names the core API it uses, cited by file and function; anything not on the ledger must justify itself in an ADR before being written custom."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_core_api_ledger", "label": "Core-API mapping ledger (the use-core table)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_lib_php", "label": "lib.php: thin bridge of module callbacks (instances, grades, calendar, reset, pluginfile)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Callbacks are plain functions core looks up by name (function_exists); a misspelled callback is never called and nothing complains, so names must be exact."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_classes_entry_php", "label": "classes/entry.php: entry persistence and queries, single source of DML", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_classes_files_php", "label": "classes/files.php: pluginfile access decisions kept apart from send_stored_file()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_pluginfile_chain", "label": "pluginfile access chain: module context, require_login, view capability, owner-or-givefeedback, send_stored_file()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The split exists because send_stored_file() ends the request, so the access decision has to be callable without it to be testable; pattern follows assignsubmission_file_pluginfile()."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_data_model", "label": "Data model: reflectjournal + reflectjournal_entries tables (db/install.xml + upgrade.php)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two places for every schema change: install.xml and upgrade.php behind a savepoint with version.php bumped, so fresh install and upgrade end at the same schema. No draft state: an entry row exists means submitted; timecreated is the submission time."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_keys_documentation_only", "label": "Keys are documentation; nothing cascades (no FK constraints in Moodle)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every driver leaves sql_generator::$foreign_keys false, so a foreign key becomes a plain index; child rows are deleted explicitly in delete_instance, the privacy provider and reset_userdata. UNIQUE KEY is still enforced as a unique index."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_unique_entry_key", "label": "UNIQUE KEY (reflectjournalid, userid): enforces one entry per learner", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_duplicate_key_recovery", "label": "Duplicate-key race recovery: catch dml_write_exception, re-read, update", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two saves racing for one learner can both pass the exists-check; the unique index is the enforcement. The race test is deterministic: entry::find_existing() is the single existence probe and the test swaps a subclass that inserts the competing row on its first call."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_no_delegated_transaction_save", "label": "Save path never runs inside a delegated transaction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On PostgreSQL a failed INSERT puts the whole transaction into an aborted state, so the re-read would fail too; entry::save() starts with $DB->transactions_forbidden() which throws dml_transaction_exception."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_core_persistent_rejected", "label": "core\\persistent evaluated and not adopted for the entry row", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "create() always writes a usermodified column this table does not have; only 3 of 38 extenders in 5.3 are activity modules; revisit if a second table appears."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_capability_addinstance", "label": "Capability mod/reflectjournal:addinstance (course, editingteacher+manager, RISK_XSS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_capability_view", "label": "Capability mod/reflectjournal:view (open activity, read own entry and feedback)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_capability_submit", "label": "Capability mod/reflectjournal:submit (create and edit own entry until deadline)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_capability_givefeedback", "label": "Capability mod/reflectjournal:givefeedback (read any entry, open grade.php, save feedback)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_capability_grade", "label": "Capability mod/reflectjournal:grade (grade field and its save action only)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Opens no page of its own: grade.php requires givefeedback; the grade save additionally requires :grade plus sesskey."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_require_login_capability", "label": "require_login() + require_capability() on every route", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_require_sesskey", "label": "require_sesskey() / confirm_sesskey() on every write", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_param_apis", "label": "required_param()/optional_param() with PARAM_* (never $_GET/$_POST)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_grade_update", "label": "grade_update() - the only grade write path (lib/gradelib.php)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A grade is addressed by user id only, so a learner with no entry can be graded; it creates or updates the grade item."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_grade_item_read_path", "label": "Reading a grade: grade_item::fetch() then get_grade($userid, false)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "false so that merely looking does not insert an empty grade row; grade_get_grades() is avoided because its docblock warns it can trigger a full course regrade."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_grade_grade_is_hidden", "label": "grade_grade::is_hidden() - grade visibility gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Covers both hide levels: a grade hidden for that learner in the Grader report and the item's Hidden / Hidden until; any grade shown inside the activity must go through it."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_rescale_grades_keep_percentage", "label": "grade_item::rescale_grades_keep_percentage() - gradebook-side rescale helper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_rescale_callback", "label": "reflectjournal_rescale_activity_grades() callback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No plugin data involved: loads the grade item and calls rescale_grades_keep_percentage(); must return true or core throws cannotreprocessgrades (a null return fails too)."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_learner_grade_display", "label": "What a learner sees: own grade shown only while grade_grade::is_hidden() is false", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cheap read-only path; no gate on the course showgrades setting because no core activity consults it before displaying a grade inside the activity."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_grade_visibility_gradebook", "label": "Grade visibility owned by the gradebook (no FEATURE_CONTROLS_GRADE_VISIBILITY, no hidden in itemdetails)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The plugin keeps no flag and has no release mechanism; two core settings apply (item hidden/hidden-until and per-learner hide in the Grader report); feedback is not a grade and is never hidden this way."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_get_enrolled_sql", "label": "get_enrolled_sql($context, 'mod/reflectjournal:submit', 0, true) - submissions list base query", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The last true is $onlyactive, so suspended, not-yet-started and ended enrolments are left out; no group filtering in v1."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_submissions_list", "label": "Submissions list: core_table\\sql_table over get_enrolled_sql with LEFT JOIN on entries", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core paging and sorting; a learner with no entry still gets a row."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_clock_di", "label": "core\\clock via core\\di - never time() in plugin code", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tests freeze it with mock_clock_with_frozen(); the deadline check reads the clock so saves one second before and exactly on the deadline are tested exactly."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_dates_class", "label": "mod_reflectjournal\\dates extends core\\activity_dates - deadline on the course page", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_calendar_integration", "label": "Calendar integration: provide_event_action + event_timestart_updated callbacks + reflectjournal_refresh_events()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without the action callback the event is not shown on the dashboard; without the timestart callback it cannot be dragged; core also calls refresh_events() after course reset and after restore."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_completion_custom_completion", "label": "Custom completion: completionsubmit rule via classes/completion/custom_completion.php", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "State is entry-row-exists, refreshed with completion_info::update_state(); no view rule because FEATURE_COMPLETION_TRACKS_VIEWS is not declared; the rule is published via get_coursemodule_info customdata."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_events_api_logging", "label": "Events API logging: entry_submitted, entry_updated, feedback_added, course_module_viewed, course_module_instance_list_viewed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_output_renderer", "label": "Output: mod_reflectjournal\\output\\renderer + renderables + Mustache templates", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No inline HTML in PHP; classes get the renderer through core\\output\\renderer_helper, not the $PAGE/$OUTPUT globals."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_format_text_cleaning", "label": "Output cleaning: every stored text printed through format_text()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "5.3 editors store text uncleaned, so output is where content is purified; never noclean; in Mustache triple-brace only for HTML that format_text() returned; tests save script tags in prompt, entry and feedback."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_supports_features", "label": "reflectjournal_supports(): six declared features + deliberately undeclared ones", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FEATURE_GROUPMEMBERSONLY must never be passed (plugin_supports() throws); group features not declared in v1; FEATURE_COMPLETION_TRACKS_VIEWS and FEATURE_CONTROLS_GRADE_VISIBILITY deliberately omitted."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_feature_mod_purpose_assessment", "label": "FEATURE_MOD_PURPOSE = MOD_PURPOSE_ASSESSMENT", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_course_reset", "label": "Course reset: reset_course_form_definition/defaults + reflectjournal_reset_userdata()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must return an array or core reports reset not implemented; deletes entries and their files itself; clears its grade item via grade_item_update($instance,'reset'); shifts deadline with shift_course_mod_dates(); core refreshes calendar events right after."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_backup_restore_scope", "label": "Backup/restore scope: config always, entries behind user-data setting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "userid and feedbackby remapped with get_mappingid('user') (missing user maps to 0); deadline shifted via apply_date_offset; files via add_related_files; action events are not copied so restore queues refresh_mod_calendar_events_task."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_privacy_provider", "label": "classes/privacy/provider.php: metadata, export, delete, userlist provider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Implements the metadata provider, plugin provider and core_userlist_provider (mandatory); grades belong to the gradebook and are covered by its own provider."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_feedbackby_column", "label": "feedbackby column: id of the teacher who wrote the feedback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Needed so the learner can see who responded and so tests can check who saved what; declared in privacy metadata alongside userid."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_suspended_learners_limitation", "label": "Known limitation: suspended learners not in the submissions list (entries stay, completion holds)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Matches core's participants list; rows are not deleted; a show-suspended filter gated on both moodle/course:enrolreview and moodle/course:viewsuspendedusers is nice-to-have."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_no_delete_entry", "label": "Known limitation: no delete-entry action for anyone", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This is what keeps completion once earned, stays true."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_test_generators", "label": "Test generators: tests/generator/lib.php (PHPUnit) + behat_mod_reflectjournal_generator.php", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_tests_design_needs", "label": "Tests this design needs (XSS cleaning, server-side deadline, race, transaction guard, hidden grades, file access, capability split, teacher erasure, rescale, locked grades, backup round-trip, privacy, calendar, completion)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_future_external_api", "label": "Future: external web service via namespaced core_external API (db/services.php + classes/external/)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Old global external_* names are deprecated in 5.3 (MDL-81225); the web service must not call the save path inside a transaction because of the PostgreSQL aborted state."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_future_hooks_api", "label": "Future: Hooks API registrations (db/hooks.php, PSR-14 array notation)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0004", "label": "ADR-0004 (dev stack: plugin at repo root, docker bind-mount, nested moodle/+ci/ shadowed)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_architecture", "target": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture", "target": "docs_adr_0008_feedbackby_privacy_semantics", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture", "target": "docs_adr_0004", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture", "target": "d